%h2= "#{t('activerecord.models.ddt/call_setting')} 详情"
%p 订单呼叫功能：用户在下单15分钟~25分钟以后，如果商家仍未确认订单或者取消订单，系统将自动发起电话呼叫，通知商家进行订单处理，以免因各种原因导致的漏单。需要注意的是，系统默认赠送0.5元给所有用户体验该功能，如需继续使用，请联系充值。注：呼叫费用为0.1元/分钟

.wrapper.wrapper-content.animated.fadeInRight.ecommerce
  .row
    .col-lg-12
      .ibox
        .ibox-content
          %p
            %b
              = Ddt::CallSetting.human_attribute_name(:enable_order_call)
              \:
            = t(@call_setting.enable_order_call?.to_s)
          %p
            %b
              = Ddt::CallSetting.human_attribute_name(:amount)
              \:
            = @call_setting.amount_in_currency
          %p
            %b
              = Ddt::CallSetting.human_attribute_name(:used_amount)
              \:
            = @call_setting.used_amount_in_currency
          .space

          = link_to t('Edit'), edit_backend_shop_call_setting_path(@current_shop), :class => "btn btn-primary"
